# Gix's Command, "Choose two": modes 1 and 4. Bot1 puts two +1/+1 counters on its own Ornithopter (it gains lifelink),
# then each opponent sacrifices a creature with the greatest power among their creatures: Bot2's Elvish Mystic and
# Llanowar Elves tie at power 1, so Bot2 chooses the Mystic. No mode has a target; everything is chosen on resolution.

